    "detailed_description": "Join Maleqqi's Journey.<br><br>On a day, Maleqqi feels a strange sound coming. He feels it through his body.<br>We wants to find its source. Because this can be the only thing that fulfill his heart.<br><br>He meets a Knight that says he can help if Maleqqi proves himself.<br>And the journey begins.<br><br>Maleqqi<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923850/extras/65db33d6852f3cd655abd609fdcafc46.poster.avif?t=1711524048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923850/extras/65db33d6852f3cd655abd609fdcafc46.webm?t=1711524048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923850/extras/65db33d6852f3cd655abd609fdcafc46.mp4?t=1711524048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Power (of) Metal is a Platformer with some Megaman-like features.<br><br>- Proceed through the castle with amazing platformer levels.<br>- Beat the bosses and take their powerful abilities.<br>- Discover every part of the levels to find secrets.<br>- Immersive Boss battles.<br>- Great Metal Music that will accompany through the levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923850/extras/9b5d06cbd99cd0b1d4ac4dae9230ef53.poster.avif?t=1711524048\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923850/extras/9b5d06cbd99cd0b1d4ac4dae9230ef53.webm?t=1711524048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923850/extras/9b5d06cbd99cd0b1d4ac4dae9230ef53.mp4?t=1711524048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite